(7505191, 1196646, 114225, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were going for here, but I think this could be better. Here would be my suggestions.<br/> <br/>1. This is a portrait, but the face is not in focus. I understand that you focused on the guitar, but since her face is here, it''s a portrait. Either have the face in focus, or crop so that the top have of her is not in the photo.<br/> <br/>2. That ceiling light is the brightest thing in the photo, and it''s not appealing. Maybe move around to not have those ceiling lights shown.<br/> <br/>3. It''s a bit dark for my tastes.</td>', 'I can see what you were going for here, but I think this could be better. Here would be my suggestions. 1. This is a portrait, but the face is not in focus. I understand that you focused on the guitar, but since her face is here, it''s a portrait. Either have the face in focus, or crop so that the top have of her is not in the photo. 2. That ceiling light is the brightest thing in the photo, and it''s not appealing. Maybe move around to not have those ceiling lights shown. 3. It''s a bit dark for my tastes.', '2017-03-14 16:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7505192, 1196668, 114225, '<td valign="top">That''s cool.</td>', 'That''s cool.', '2017-03-14 16:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
